# DUAL-KERNEL ADAPTER: EXPANDING SPATIAL HORIZONS FOR DATA-CONSTRAINED MEDICAL IMAGE ANALYSIS

Ziquan Zhu1\*, Hanruo Zhu1\*, Si-Yuan Lu2\*, Xiang Li3, Yanda Meng4, Gaojie Jin⁵ Lu Yin6, Lijie Hu7, Di Wang7, Lu Liu⁵, Tianjin Huang5,9†

